<title>USA: RF Industries names Gross CFO.</title>
<headline>RF Industries names Gross CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>RF Industries Ltd Monday named Terrie Gross to the post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, RF Industries said Gross replaces Howard Hill, who resigned from his position as chief financial officer but remains president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Previously Gross was corporate secretary and principal accounting officer.</p>
